  "_comment": "Product photos bundled inside Bosch's own Flow app (config.xxxhdpi.apk resource split), extracted with the repo owner's explicit go-ahead since these are plain product photography, not creative art. Keys are matched against a component's PRODUCT_CODE, longest key first, exact match preferred over prefix match — see partImageFor() in app.js. Two drive-unit prefixes (BDU374, BDU384) each cover two visually distinct product lines in Flow's own asset set (e.g. Cargo Line vs Performance Line CX) and Flow disambiguates on a full code we don't have two confirmed samples for yet, so only the single exact code we've actually seen on real hardware is wired in here; the sibling files are still shipped in web/parts/ for future refinement.",
